If I have conflict, I figure almost everything else is a "pet", so to
speak, and thus my own pets are either disenchanters or expendable.  
Priests and shopkeepers, yeah, I usually want them to not hit me
and stay alive, so I pull it off for those.

> The only other reason not to wear the ring at all times is hunger, but 

